{"id":"6cf84af4e13352c5","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-suslin-operation.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive2 Suslin Operation","display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-suslin-operation — ZFC Descriptive2 Suslin Operation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-suslin-operation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive2-suslin-operation","58-df-zfc-descriptive3-suslin-operation"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-suslin-operation — ZFC Descriptive2 Suslin Operation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-suslin-operation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-suslin-operation</span><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-suslin-operation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive2-suslin-operation — ZFC Descriptive2 Suslin Operation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,F,X,\\mathcal A,x,n\\in V\">\\(S,F,X,\\mathcal A,x,n\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2SuslinOperation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2SuslinOperation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3SuslinOperation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3SuslinOperation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n\">\\(A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^n\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\">\\(A^n\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\">\\(|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\)</span> 仅对有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 使用；函数图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}operation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2SuslinOperation}_S(S,F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(F,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land S=\\bigcup_{x\\in\\omega^\\omega}\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}F(x\\upharpoonright n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}operation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2SuslinOperation}_S(S,F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(F,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land S=\\bigcup_{x\\in\\omega^\\omega}\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}F(x\\upharpoonright n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}operation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3SuslinOperation}_S(X,\\mathcal A,S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal A,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},\\mathcal P(X))\\land S=\\bigcup_{x\\in\\omega^\\omega}\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathcal A(x\\upharpoonright n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}operation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3SuslinOperation}_S(X,\\mathcal A,S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal A,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},\\mathcal P(X))\\land S=\\bigcup_{x\\in\\omega^\\omega}\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathcal A(x\\upharpoonright n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The two-argument variant uses the set range of the scheme instead of the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as a codomain.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-suslin-operation</code> is merged here; it used the same Suslin scheme union-intersection operation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"